- **View** — shell + header + all states (loading/empty/error/stale/offline/content) and compact/standard/wide layouts (3 gauges + driving-style chip + histogram).
- **Previews / Tests / ModelTests / strings** — per-state previews, 36 XCTest methods, 30 i18n keys.

